# Completed ponder results wait; ponderhit retains time already spent.
@phase 6.1
> Manta {{VERSION}} by Miloslav Macurek
< go ponder wtime 10000 btime 10000 nodes 1 searchmoves e2e4
> info string invalid go: Ponder option is false
< setoption name Ponder value true
< position startpos
< go ponder wtime 10000 btime 10000 nodes 1 searchmoves e2e4
! allow-info begin
! silence 100ms
< isready
> readyok
< ponderhit
> bestmove e2e4
! allow-info end
< ponderhit
< stop
! silence 100ms
< quit
! exit 0 within 1000ms

---

# Stop publishes a retained completed ponder exactly once.
@phase 6.1
> Manta {{VERSION}} by Miloslav Macurek
< setoption name Ponder value true
< position startpos
< go ponder wtime 10000 btime 10000 nodes 1 searchmoves d2d4
! allow-info begin
! silence 100ms
< stop
> bestmove d2d4
! allow-info end
< stop
< ponderhit
! silence 100ms
< quit
! exit 0 within 1000ms

---

# An option barrier completes the old ponder before disabling future ponder.
@phase 6.1
> Manta {{VERSION}} by Miloslav Macurek
< setoption name Ponder value true
< position startpos
< go ponder wtime 10000 btime 10000 searchmoves g1f3
! allow-info begin
< setoption name Ponder value false
> bestmove g1f3{{PONDER}}
! allow-info end
< go ponder wtime 10000 btime 10000 nodes 1 searchmoves e2e4
> info string invalid go: Ponder option is false
< ponderhit extra
> info string invalid ponderhit: unexpected argument
< quit
! exit 0 within 1000ms
